Episode 21

Dunia Sihir

00:24:20.190 --> 00:24:22.730
Dasar amatir.

00:24:20.820 --> 00:24:23.030
Sihir yang kuinginkan?

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:22.980
Perbedaan daya sihirnya

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.030
terlalu besar.

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.030
Tapi dia lengah.

00:24:22.530 --> 00:24:24.780
Beri aku istirahat.

00:24:23.610 --> 00:24:25.780
Berlebihan sekali.

00:24:24.740 --> 00:24:26.990
Kakek tua itu.

00:24:23.820 --> 00:24:26.030
Aku tahu!

00:24:24.570 --> 00:24:26.780
Namanya Frieren.

